#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0044 expect=violation domain=ADAE
#note "PLAN-engine-fixture-join-key-drift: ported from cumba-corej CdiscAd0044And0045IntegrationTest.cdiscAd0044_mismatchedTimePart_oneViolation. Numeric SAS values, the ADaM shape: ASTDTM 86400.5 is day 1 at 00:00:00.5, ASTTM 0.6 is 00:00:00.6 -> the time part differs -> violation."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASTDTM  type=Num format=DATETIME20.
col ASTTM   type=Num format=TIME8.
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 86400.5 | 0.6
